{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>ואם בא</b> — one to visit." "<b>שוא ידבר</b> — to me: how greatly it grieved me that you are ill." "<b>ידבר</b> — to others words of belial about me, upon going outside he speaks to my other enemies, who have not seen me do evil: a severe illness is fixed in him, like לבו יצוק כמו אבן (his heart is cast like stone)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:28.797395944Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}